        <type>bool</type>
        <definition>bool themis::tensor::TensorIngestionBridge::shouldDecompose</definition>
        <argsstring>(const std::vector&lt; float &gt; &amp;embedding, double min_kappa=1.3) const override</argsstring>
        <name>shouldDecompose</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::tensor::TensorIngestionBridge::shouldDecompose</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const std::vector&lt; float &gt; &amp;</type>
          <declname>embedding</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>double</type>
          <declname>min_kappa</declname>
          <defval>1.3</defval>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>κ-gate: returns true when estimated compression ratio ≥ <computeroutput>min_kappa</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Runs a pilot TT-decomposition with a coarser tolerance (pilot_eps = epsilon / 5, min 0.05) to quickly estimate the achievable compression ratio without the full cost.</para>
<para>For embeddings with dim ≤ 1024, the full embedding is used for the pilot. For dim &gt; 1024, a random projection to 1024 elements is used to keep the pilot cost bounded. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
